---

<Layout
  title="Hoi An & Da Nang Wedding Photographer | Cris Maturana"
  description="Documentary wedding photography in Hoi An, Da Nang, and across Vietnam &amp; Chile. Real moments, no forced poses."
  lang="en"
  canonical="https://www.crismaturana.com/hoi-an-wedding-photographer"
  alternates={alternates}
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Documentary Wedding Photography",
      "provider": {
        "@type": "LocalBusiness",
        "name": "Cris Maturana Photo",
        "url": "https://www.crismaturana.com",
        "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Hội An", "addressCountry": "VN" }
      },
      "areaServed": ["Hội An", "Da Nang", "Vietnam", "Chile"]
    })} />
  <div class="gallery-hero">
    <div class="gallery-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="gallery-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="gallery-hero-content">
      <p class="hero-label">Portfolio · Weddings</p>
      <p class="hero-location">Hội An · Da Nang · Chile · Southeast Asia</p>
      <h1>Moments that<br>last forever.</h1>
      <p class="hero-text">Weddings are a mix of chaos, emotion, and everything in between. I stay in the background, close enough to catch what matters.</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><p class="stat-num">15+</p><p class="stat-label">Years</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><p class="stat-num">100+</p><p class="stat-label">Couples</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><p class="stat-num stat-sm">Always</p><p class="stat-label">Present</p></div>
        <div class="stat stat-text"><p class="stat-num stat-sm">Natural & Spontaneous</p><p class="stat-label">Style · Estilo</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="/investment" class="cta-btn">Check Rates &amp; Packages</a>
        <a href="/contact?session=Wedding" class="cta-link">Book a Session →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="section gallery-section">
    <div class="container">
      <Gallery images={images} layout="masonry" columns={3} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section service-section">
    <div class="container service-copy">

      <h2>What to Expect</h2>
      <p>
        On the day, I stay close but out of the way — no stopping you mid-laugh to pose, no
        forced looks at the camera. I follow the ceremony, the reactions, the small moments
        between the big ones: a hand squeezed under the table, your mother's face during the
        vows. Coverage typically runs 4–12 hours depending on your package, and I shoot in
        available light whenever possible to keep things feeling real rather than performed.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Book with Cris?</h2>
      <p>
        I've been documenting weddings for 15+ years, originally in Chile and now from Hội An,
        Vietnam, with regular coverage in Da Nang as well — which means I've shot in nearly
        every kind of light, weather, and family dynamic there is. My approach is shaped by
        documentary photographers like Steve McCurry and Fan Ho: patience over direction, and
        trust that real moments are always more interesting than staged ones. You won't get a
        shot list of forced poses — you'll get the day as it actually happened.
      </p>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you travel to Da Nang for weddings?</summary>
        <p>Yes — Da Nang is about 30–45 minutes from Hoi An, and I regularly shoot weddings and elopements there with no additional travel complexity.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How many photos will we receive, and how long does delivery take?</summary>
        <p>You'll get a sneak peek within 24 hours, and the fully edited gallery delivered within 30 days depending on your package.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How do I book?</summary>
        <p>Fill in the contact form at crismaturana.com/contact. I'll reply within 24–48 hours to schedule a short call. A 30–50% deposit secures your date.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do you shoot weddings outside Vietnam?</summary>
        <p>Yes — I travel to Chile every year for wedding season (October–February). <a href="/wedding-pricing-chile">See Chile wedding rates and availability →</a></p>
      </details>

      <div class="custom-quote">
        <p class="custom-label">Let's Work Together</p>
        <h2 class="custom-heading">Start the conversation</h2>
        <p class="custom-text">Tell me about your date and what you're imagining — I'll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact?session=Wedding" class="btn btn-accent custom-cta">Start the Conversation →</a>
        <p class="custom-text" style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
          <a href="/investment">Check rates &amp; packages →</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .gallery-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .gallery-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('https://CrisMaturana.b-cdn.net/Weddings/wedding-photographer-hoi-an-hero-01.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    filter: blur(6px) brightness(1.1);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .gallery-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  }

  .gallery-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 7rem 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.35em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hero-location {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6f6b65;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gallery-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #1a1a18;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #4a4a48;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #c9a96e;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-sm {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(160, 120, 64, 0.6);
    padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6f6b65;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }

  .stat-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.75rem;
    background: #e8c070;
    color: #1a1a18;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover { background: #c9a050; }

  .cta-link {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-link:hover { color: rgba(160, 120, 64, 0.85); }

  .gallery-section {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .service-section {
    padding-top: 0;
    margin-top: -30px;
  }

  .service-copy {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .service-copy h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .service-copy p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .service-copy a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .service-copy details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .service-copy summary {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .service-copy details p {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .custom-quote {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    position: relative;
  }

  .custom-quote::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .custom-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .custom-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .custom-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .custom-text a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .custom-cta {
    display: inline-block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gallery-hero-content {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 7rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }
    .hero-text { max-width: 100%; }
    .hero-stats { justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .stat-text { align-items: center; }
    .hero-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
